  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.11\n  add primitive array (byte[]) mapping support\n\n  Fix ArgumentException when mapping byte[], int[], char[] and other\n  primitive arrays that were incorrectly treated as mappable collections.\n\n  - Add IsPrimitiveArray() helper to detect simple-type arrays\n  - Exclude primitive arrays from IsComplexType and IsCollectionType\n  - Copy primitive arrays via Array.Clone() in compiled and reflection paths\n  - Add byte[] mapping samples (MemberEntity/MemberDto ProfilePhoto scenario)",
